00:05:25.370 --> 00:05:29.920
A wedding present for Aunt Letitia. A picture of Eric as a baby.

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:34.960
Pardon me, please.

00:05:35.120 --> 00:05:35.720
Where are you going?

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:40.500
Going out to the club car and get quietly but effectively plastered.

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:09.690
- I think this will do very nicely, don't you, Henry? - Yeah, it's comfortable. Home-like.

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.210
