00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:39.870
- Is there anything else, sir? - No, that's all.

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:43.340
- Thank you, sir. - It's unusually hot for this time of year, isn't it?

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:44.500
Yes, it is, sir.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:10.040
- Henry, have you got... - Ah, yes.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:13.180
Thank you.

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:16.170
